      48.01,
      451.69,
      542.51,
      485.16
    ],
    "text": "BY virtue of the powers vested in me by section 9 of the Civil Aviation Authority of Sri Lanka Act, No. 34 of 2002, I, Bimal Niroshan Rathnayaka, Minister of Transport, Highways, Ports and Civil Aviation, do by this Order amend the Order made under Section 9 of the aforesaid Act and Published in the Gazette Extraordinary, No.2142/74 dated September 26, 2019-",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      48.01,
      491.69,
      542.48,
      515.16
    ],
    "text": "(a) by the substitution for the words, \"the Jaffna International Airport\", of the words \"Palali Airport presently called and Known as the Jaffna International Airport\", and",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      48.0,
      521.69,
      429.23,
      535.16
    ],
    "text": "(b) by the repeal of the Schedule thereto and the substitution therefor, of the following: -",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
