      561.69,
      542.47,
      655.16
    ],
    "text": "All that divided and defined allotment of land Called the \"Palali Airport presently called and known as the Jaffna International Airport depicted by Lots 1 to 456 in the Survey Plan PPA 1579 and situated within the Grama Niladhari divisions of Myladdy North, Myladdy South and Palali in Valikamam North of the Tellippalai Divisional Secretariat in the District of Jaffna, in the Northern Province, containing in extent Acres 349 - Roods 03 - Perches 35.9 together with the runway and the runway strip and the whole portion of the of the airport land located northwards abutting the runway.\". Bimal Niroshan Rathnayaka, Minister of Transport, Highways, Ports and Civil Aviation.",
